{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05160","headline":"和燕公别㴩湖 · 赵冬曦","name":"和燕公别㴩湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南湖美泉石，君子翫幽奇。\n湾澳陪临泛，岩峿共践窥。\n秋风赬桂竦，春景绿杨垂。\n郢路委分竹，湘滨拥去麾。\n枉帆怀胜赏，留景惜差池。\n水木且不弃，情由良可知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}